      "result": "pass",
      "summary": "Current phone and tablet originals retain an iOS-disciplined hierarchy without decorative glass or dashboard-card excess: current evidence and the dominant abnormal state lead, dense operational objects remain comparable, typography keeps names, rates and failure states scanable, and read-only actions are visually bounded. The tablet workbench uses space for stable object selection and inspection rather than mechanically widening phone cards."
    },
