      "summary": "The inspected source confines motion to short press, color and disclosure feedback; frequent patrol navigation and telemetry presentation do not animate. Active/focus feedback is present, and reduced-motion rules remove the transition and scale feedback. This is purposeful, interruptible feedback rather than decorative motion."
